# TODO comments (ScreenshotTool)

When adding or editing `TODO` comments, include the **owner handle** in parentheses.

## Format

```ts
// TODO(foxykeep) Wire drag-drop image load into the canvas.
```

- One space after the closing `)`
- Imperative / sentence case; keep it brief
- Use the repo owner's personal handle (e.g. `foxykeep`), not a GMID

## Do not

- `TODO:` without an owner
- `TODO - fix later`
